Symmetric cipher tests used with the "KAT_Cipher" type.
.It \(dqSHA1" ( Ns Sy OSSL_SELF_TEST_DESC_MD_SHA1 )
.It \(dqSHA2" ( Ns Sy OSSL_SELF_TEST_DESC_MD_SHA2 )
.It \(dqSHA3" ( Ns Sy OSSL_SELF_TEST_DESC_MD_SHA3 )
Digest tests used with the "KAT_Digest" type.
.It \(dqDSA" ( Ns Sy OSSL_SELF_TEST_DESC_SIGN_DSA )
